+BinOp "%"	semantics/syntax.k:15 [seqstrict(2,3)]	semantics/operators.k:12; semantics/int.k:15,19-20	Left-to-right integer operands; supplied pyMod matches Python modulo for nonzero n.
+BinOp "//"	semantics/syntax.k:15 [seqstrict(2,3)]	semantics/operators.k:12; semantics/int.k:16	Computes (x-pyMod(x,n))/n, Python floor division for nonzero n.
